      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i need some advice. my neighbor has this huge automated hydroponic setup right by my window and the misting cycles happen like every hour. every time they mist, there's this really heavy, sweet-smelling chemical scent that drifts into my bedroom. it's making me feel super lightheaded and anxious. what are some ways i can neutralize or filter out these airborne particulates so they dont get into my house?",
